Z||000000||WhiteFieroBlur||10-22-2001||11:58 AM||||OK I called fiero conversions today and they told me they are shipping my 7 inch stands out today. I have like the biggest smile on my face  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> It took them from the time I sent the money wich was on 10/3 till now which is 10/22. I guess that wasn't too bad. Now I have to bite my nails on how long it takes to get shipped.<P> Now I havn't posted any pics of my car on here before cause I have no camera, but my friend has one so as soon as I get them on i'll get pics of them on my car so ya'll can see if you wanna get them.<P> They told me they have make alot of other stuff like scoops and stuff but with no way of getting pics its kinda scary to order. But they have been doing this for some time so I am sure the quality is good. I told him if he does a good job on my stands that hes gonna get alot of orders for some  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. But this source is reliable for our stands so if you want to go ahead and orde them I would say go ahead. I am sure they have more sizes than just the 7inches.<P> Also does anyone have the number to IRM? for the rocker scoops I hear they are 550 but I don't care I must spend money on my car before the start of the year  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. If anyone has any for sale or know of another great place to get the rocker scoops (besides the stage 2)let me know and who don't take years to get. I also need a great lookin front chin spoiler or front end from a kit.||||reg||10
Z||000001||Fiero5||10-22-2001||12:32 PM||||WhiteFieroBlur,<P>I don't know IRM's number, but you can call this Fiero club and ask: (281) 897-0813<BR>Though I bet someone else will have the number and post it here soon?<P>Just an FYI, here are a few other scources for wing stands in the past. The Fiero Shop in Canada has advertised the wing stands I think.<BR>Phone number 416-747-5728 <BR>and the web site is: <A HREF="http://www.thefieroshop.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefieroshop.com</A> <P>PISA sells the wing stantions at stock height of 2-1/2" or the next height up of 4-1/2" at $69/pair.<BR>PISA's number is 602-376-1550 or the web addy: <A HREF="http://www.cybercars.com." TARGET=_blank>www.cybercars.com.</A> <P>Worst case scenario-last resort type of thing...FOCOA &gt;Arrrgh&lt; <BR>Their new phone number <BR>is: 714-635-0898. They sell the wing stands<BR>in different heights, but good luck reaching anyone, or not getting ripped off by them if you do. Be carefull not to hit the porno FOCOA web site either  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>FOCOA sells the wing stantions last I knew at three seperate heights: 7 1/2" at $99. a set, 4 3/4" at $69. a set and <BR>stock height at $59. a set.<P>Hope this helps.<P>Steve||||reg||6
