Z||000030||Monkeyman||11-11-2001||06:25 AM||||It's been 5 weeks since they said they were going to "send them out tomorrow".  I'd call them Monday and tell them to either send your stands or send your money back.  You can always find another set of stands.  If they tell you that they'll be sent out tomorrow for sure, you tell them you want a tracking number by the end of business today.  Period.  If not, you'll contact an attorney (not EdsB52).  Then I'd really contact an attorney.  For the cost of an hours visit, he could at least send them a threatening letter.  You've waited long enough.||||reg||1
