Z||000038||WhiteFieroBlur||11-21-2001||05:02 PM||||ok I just called these people and I talked to the lady ok here was the situation. And this is the first time I talked to her.<P> OK she told me that thier resin for the fiberglass was some very bad stuff. They said everytime they tried to make my stands the resin would not harden. She said they had to go thru 2 orders of this stuff cause they kept coming up bad.<P> Well she said that my stands are finished and on her desk right now and shipping out tomorrow. I asked her if it usually takes this long to get parts and she says no. How come bad things always happen to me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">. Well she said they will be shipped in 3-5 days. I guess this is a believable story and I should get them in a week. <P>Also she is mailing me a catalog I'll let ya'll know what kinda stuff they have. Now if this is the case I guess its safe to order them. But you know you can't always trust people and what they say. <P> ||||reg||1
